WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.820
- While Heidi and I when
we had to repeat clothes

00:00:02.820 --> 00:00:04.070
because of the auditions

00:00:04.070 --> 00:00:05.349
- We don't like it.
- We're like

00:00:05.349 --> 00:00:06.182
- Again!

00:00:06.182 --> 00:00:07.439
- "We don't want to work anymore here."

00:00:07.439 --> 00:00:08.349
(laughing)

00:00:08.349 --> 00:00:10.510
"work in the same outfit
for two days in a row"

00:00:10.510 --> 00:00:11.770
- I think this is the
hardest for us because

00:00:11.770 --> 00:00:14.100
sometimes we're like five
days in the same look

00:00:14.100 --> 00:00:16.390
and honestly, the outfit
can walk by itself.

00:00:16.390 --> 00:00:17.780
We're always talking to one another.

00:00:17.780 --> 00:00:19.970
We're like " Again the same outfit!"

00:00:19.970 --> 00:00:20.803
- We hate it!

00:00:20.803 --> 00:00:22.530
(laughing) [Kelly] That's
actually happened to me on a show.

00:00:22.530 --> 00:00:23.830
You have to wear it for
like five days in a row and

00:00:23.830 --> 00:00:25.820
it's like you have to
be very specific about

00:00:25.820 --> 00:00:26.960
what you're wearing because

00:00:26.960 --> 00:00:28.737
especially if it's stretchy at all

00:00:28.737 --> 00:00:29.570
(scoff)

00:00:29.570 --> 00:00:31.676
Like, elasticity wears and so

00:00:31.676 --> 00:00:32.509
(laughing)

00:00:32.509 --> 00:00:33.342
by day five

00:00:33.342 --> 00:00:34.175
- It's like a complete different dress.

00:00:34.175 --> 00:00:35.400
That happens to me all the time.

00:00:35.400 --> 00:00:37.077
I sit down for three
days and then it's like,

00:00:37.077 --> 00:00:37.990
"What is this?"

00:00:37.990 --> 00:00:40.510
It's like, "Oh no, now you
have to do the red carpet."

00:00:40.510 --> 00:00:42.357
I'm just like, "I just can't. I can't"

00:00:42.357 --> 00:00:43.269
(laughing)

00:00:43.269 --> 00:00:44.328
- [Kelly] And no, it's stretches as well.

00:00:44.328 --> 00:00:45.660
Especially if it's like a jumpsuit.

00:00:45.660 --> 00:00:46.917
I did a jumpsuit one time I was like,

00:00:46.917 --> 00:00:48.300
"How is this elongated?"

00:00:48.300 --> 00:00:49.970
Like it's longer and I'm so short

00:00:49.970 --> 00:00:50.803
- [Sofia] Cut from here.

00:00:50.803 --> 00:00:51.636
- So we just cut the bottom off...

00:00:51.636 --> 00:00:53.020
Yeah, it's like really hard.

00:00:53.020 --> 00:00:54.210
- All of a sudden it's a drop crotch.

00:00:54.210 --> 00:00:56.520
- Yeah, all of a sudden.
Which is not attractive

00:00:56.520 --> 00:00:57.620
on a person that's 5'3".

00:00:57.620 --> 00:00:58.920
- [Simon] Uniforms.
(laughing)

00:00:58.920 --> 00:01:00.909
- [Group] No.
- We don't want uniforms.

00:01:00.909 --> 00:01:02.667
Look what he's saying that
we should wear uniforms.

00:01:02.667 --> 00:01:03.500
- [Heidi] No!

00:01:03.500 --> 00:01:04.709
- [Simon] Yes. It's easy.

00:01:04.709 --> 00:01:05.588
- [Terry] AGT uniform.

00:01:05.588 --> 00:01:07.930
- [Heidi] no, no no.
- [Sofia] I quit.

00:01:07.930 --> 00:01:10.830
- I am actually gonna
side with Simon on this

00:01:10.830 --> 00:01:12.628
because it'd be way easier.

00:01:12.628 --> 00:01:13.840
- You might like them.

00:01:13.840 --> 00:01:15.723
- A nice AGT uniform.

00:01:15.723 --> 00:01:17.810
You wear A, I wear G, you wear T.

00:01:17.810 --> 00:01:18.973
- [Simon] Yes.
- [Sofia] No.

00:01:18.973 --> 00:01:19.806
(laughing)

00:01:19.806 --> 00:01:21.742
How about this week we can
swap our uniforms at least.

00:01:21.742 --> 00:01:23.060
- [Heidi] Yeah.
(laughing)

00:01:23.060 --> 00:01:25.161
- Let us do it for one day please.

00:01:25.161 --> 00:01:25.994
- No.
- [Kelly] No

00:01:25.994 --> 00:01:26.827
- Look at her face she just said "nope".

00:01:26.827 --> 00:01:28.412
- Only if you let me
dress you for one day.

00:01:28.412 --> 00:01:29.245
- [Simon] Okay. Done.

00:01:29.245 --> 00:01:30.197
(gasping)
- [Kelly] Oh my god.

00:01:30.197 --> 00:01:31.460
(Audience applause)

00:01:31.460 --> 00:01:32.293
(Heidi screeching and clapping)

00:01:32.293 --> 00:01:34.765
- [Group] (laughing)

00:01:34.765 --> 00:01:35.885
- I've been waiting for this for years.

00:01:35.885 --> 00:01:36.760
- You have to keep this promise.

00:01:36.760 --> 00:01:38.693
- Why are you agreeing without my concent?

00:01:38.693 --> 00:01:41.064
(laughing)
(Kelly clapping)

00:01:41.064 --> 00:01:42.300
- We'll do it together.
We'll go shopping together.

00:01:42.300 --> 00:01:43.640
We hook him up with a new outfit.

00:01:43.640 --> 00:01:45.850
- Oh okay. Him! Okay good. Good.

00:01:45.850 --> 00:01:47.500
- Yeah you get to dress him and

00:01:47.500 --> 00:01:49.070
he gets to dress y'all.

00:01:49.070 --> 00:01:50.382
- [Terry] I thought ti was
something like a uniform.

00:01:50.382 --> 00:01:51.970
- [Heidi] This one right here!

00:01:51.970 --> 00:01:53.760
- What are you going to wear?
You have to do something.

00:01:53.760 --> 00:01:55.608
This is not just a bet that
you get Scott-free off.

00:01:55.608 --> 00:01:56.441
- I'm going shirtless.

00:01:56.441 --> 00:01:57.274
- Shirtless
- [Kelly] Okay!

00:01:57.274 --> 00:01:58.107
- I'm going shirtless.

00:01:58.107 --> 00:02:01.555
- [Kelly] That's where we
all win. Everyone wins.

00:02:01.555 --> 00:02:02.970
- [Terry] Everything
matches with shirtless.

00:02:02.970 --> 00:02:04.370
- Everyone, everything wins.

